INSERT INTO `page` VALUES (2501,182,'扭蛋抽奖页','D:\\idea\\Project\\html版本\\html不是很好版\\designs\\1.png',375,833,NULL,NULL,0,1,'2026-11-04 10:41:23','<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"width: 375px; height: 833px;\"><head><style data-wf-controls-style=\"1\">/* Shared controls: geometry may still be changed by the canvas editor. */\nhtml body [data-wf-control] {\n  box-sizing: border-box !important;\n  appearance: none !important;\n  -webkit-appearance: none !important;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  position: relative;\n  flex: none !important;\n  min-width: 0 !important;\n  min-height: 0 !important;\n  max-width: none !important;\n  max-height: none !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  margin: 0;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n  transition: background-color .18s ease, border-color .18s ease !important;\n  --wf-control-color: var(--wf-control-accent, var(--wf-chrome-active, var(--primary, #f87f2c)));\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control]::before,\nhtml body [data-wf-control]::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control] > * { display: none !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"switch\"] {\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 25px;\n  border: 0 !important;\n  border-radius: 999px !important;\n  background: var(--wf-control-off, #dfe2e6) !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"switch\"]::before {\n  content: \"\" !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  position: absolute !important;\n  top: 3px !important;\n  bottom: auto !important;\n  left: 3px !important;\n  right: auto !important;\n  height: calc(100% - 6px) !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n  aspect-ratio: 1 !important;\n  border: 0 !important;\n  border-radius: 50% !important;\n  background: #fff !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px #0002 !important;\n  transform: none !important;\n  transition: left .18s ease, transform .18s ease !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"switch\"]::after { content: none !important; display: none !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"switch\"][aria-checked=\"true\"] { background: var(--wf-control-color) !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"switch\"][aria-checked=\"true\"]::before {\n  left: calc(100% - 3px) !important;\n  transform: translateX(-100%) !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"],\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"] {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--wf-control-border, #b6bdc8) !important;\n  background: var(--bg-card, #fff) !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"] { border-radius: 5px !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"] { border-radius: 50% !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"]::before,\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"]::before { content: none !important; display: none !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"]::after,\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"]::after { content: none !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"][aria-checked=\"true\"] {\n  border-color: var(--wf-control-color) !important;\n  background: var(--wf-control-color) !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"checkbox\"][aria-checked=\"true\"]::after {\n  content: \"\" !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  position: absolute !important;\n  width: 32% !important;\n  height: 58% !important;\n  left: 34% !important;\n  top: 12% !important;\n  border: solid #fff !important;\n  border-width: 0 2px 2px 0 !important;\n  background: transparent !important;\n  transform: rotate(45deg) !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"][aria-checked=\"true\"] { border-color: var(--wf-control-color) !important; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control=\"radio\"][aria-checked=\"true\"]::after {\n  content: \"\" !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  position: absolute !important;\n  inset: 22% !important;\n  border: 0 !important;\n  border-radius: 50% !important;\n  background: var(--wf-control-color) !important;\n  transform: none !important;\n}\nhtml body [data-wf-control]:disabled,\nhtml body [data-wf-control][aria-disabled=\"true\"] { opacity: .45; cursor: not-allowed; }\nhtml body [data-wf-control]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--wf-control-color); outline-offset: 3px; }\n</style><script data-wf-controls-runtime=\"1\">(function () {\n  if (window.__wfControls) { window.__wfControls.normalize(); return; }\n  var selector = \'[data-wf-control],[role=\"switch\"],.wf-sw,[data-wf-toggle],input[type=\"checkbox\"],input[type=\"radio\"]\';\n  function editing() { return !!document.querySelector(\'script[data-wf-inject]\') && !document.body.classList.contains(\'wf-interactive\'); }\n  function native(el) { return el.tagName === \'INPUT\' && /^(checkbox|radio)$/.test(el.type); }\n  function disabled(el) { return el.disabled || el.getAttribute(\'aria-disabled\') === \'true\'; }\n  function kind(el) {\n    var declared = el.getAttribute(\'data-wf-control\');\n    if (/^(switch|checkbox|radio)$/.test(declared || \'\')) return declared;\n    if (el.getAttribute(\'role\') === \'switch\' || el.classList.contains(\'wf-sw\')) return \'switch\';\n    if (native(el)) return el.type;\n    // Old generated switch buttons are migrated; favorite/like icon buttons stay unchanged.\n    if (el.hasAttribute(\'data-wf-toggle\') && (el.classList.contains(\'switch\') || el.classList.contains(\'toggle\') || /开关/.test(el.getAttribute(\'aria-label\') || \'\'))) return \'switch\';\n    return null;\n  }\n  function checked(el) {\n    if (native(el)) return el.checked;\n    if (el.hasAttribute(\'aria-checked\')) return el.getAttribute(\'aria-checked\') === \'true\';\n    if (el.hasAttribute(\'aria-pressed\')) return el.getAttribute(\'aria-pressed\') === \'true\';\n    if (el.hasAttribute(\'data-state\')) return el.getAttribute(\'data-state\') === \'on\';\n    return el.classList.contains(\'on\') || el.classList.contains(\'checked\') || el.classList.contains(\'active\');\n  }\n  function state(el, value) {\n    el.setAttribute(\'aria-checked\', String(value));\n    if (native(el)) {\n      el.checked = value;\n      if (value) el.setAttribute(\'checked\', \'\'); else el.removeAttribute(\'checked\');\n    }\n    if (el.getAttribute(\'data-wf-control\') === \'switch\') {\n      el.setAttribute(\'aria-pressed\', String(value));\n      el.setAttribute(\'data-state\', value ? \'on\' : \'off\');\n    }\n  }\n  function normalize() {\n    document.querySelectorAll(selector).forEach(function (el) {\n      var type = kind(el);\n      if (!type) return;\n      var value = checked(el);\n      el.setAttribute(\'data-wf-control\', type);\n      if (!native(el)) {\n        el.setAttribute(\'role\', type);\n        if (el.tagName === \'BUTTON\') el.setAttribute(\'type\', \'button\');\n        else if (!el.hasAttribute(\'tabindex\')) el.setAttribute(\'tabindex\', \'0\');\n      }\n      if (!el.hasAttribute(\'data-wf-control-version\')) {\n        // Initialize geometry once. Subsequent editor moves/resizes must survive save/reload.\n        el.style.width = type === \'switch\' ? \'44px\' : \'20px\';\n        el.style.height = type === \'switch\' ? \'25px\' : \'20px\';\n        el.setAttribute(\'data-wf-control-version\', \'1\');\n      }\n      state(el, value);\n    });\n  }\n  function radioGroup(el) { return el.getAttribute(\'data-wf-radio-group\') || el.getAttribute(\'name\') || \'\'; }\n  function update(el) {\n    var type = el.getAttribute(\'data-wf-control\');\n    if (type === \'radio\') {\n      var group = radioGroup(el);\n      document.querySelectorAll(\'[data-wf-control=\"radio\"]\').forEach(function (peer) {\n        if (peer !== el && group && radioGroup(peer) === group && peer.form === el.form) state(peer, false);\n      });\n      state(el, true);\n    } else state(el, native(el) ? el.checked : !checked(el));\n  }\n  document.addEventListener(\'click\', function (event) {\n    var el = event.target.closest && event.target.closest(\'[data-wf-control]\');\n    if (!el) return;\n    if (editing()) { if (native(el)) event.preventDefault(); return; }\n    if (!native(el)) event.preventDefault();\n    // One owner: neither the old .wf-sw handler nor the generic toggle runtime may toggle again.\n    event.stopImmediatePropagation();\n    if (disabled(el)) { event.preventDefault(); return; }\n    update(el);\n  }, true);\n  document.addEventListener(\'change\', function (event) {\n    if (editing() || !native(event.target) || !event.target.hasAttribute(\'data-wf-control\')) return;\n    update(event.target);\n  }, true);\n  document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', function (event) {\n    var el = event.target.closest && event.target.closest(\'[data-wf-control]\');\n    if (!el || editing() || disabled(el) || native(el) || el.tagName === \'BUTTON\') return;\n    if (event.key === \' \' || event.key === \'Enter\') { event.preventDefault(); el.click(); }\n  });\n  window.__wfControls = { normalize: normalize };\n  function start() {\n    normalize();\n    // Controls inserted by the canvas or an opened local panel use the same implementation.\n    if (typeof MutationObserver !== \'undefined\') new MutationObserver(function (changes) {\n      var added = changes.some(function (change) {\n        return Array.from(change.addedNodes).some(function (node) {\n          return node.nodeType === 1 && (node.matches(selector) || node.querySelector(selector));\n        });\n      });\n      if (added) normalize();\n    }).observe(document.body, { childList: true, subtree: true });\n  }\n  if (document.readyState === \'loading\') document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', start);\n  else start();\n})();\n</script>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>扭蛋抽奖页</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg-page:#686872;--bg-card:#edb1cf;--primary:#f18bbb;--primary-subtle:#ffe0f0;--text-main:#fff;--text-sub:#785569;--border-light:#ffdcee}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:#303037;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\nbutton,input{font:inherit}\nbutton{border:0;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff6aa;outline-offset:3px}\nbutton{white-space:nowrap}\n.app{width:100%;max-width:375px;min-height:833px;margin:auto;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#62636d 0%,#77727d 41%,#b6a4b4 92%);color:var(--text-main)}\n.status{height:32px;padding:8px 26px 3px 25px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:#d8d8df}\n.time{font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3px}\n.status-right{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}\n.status svg{display:block}\n.toolbar{height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;margin:12px 16px 0 19px;gap:11px}\n.tool{width:38px;height:38px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;background:#82828e;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:6px}\n.tool.muted{color:#c6c5ce}\n.tool svg{width:26px;height:26px}\n.top-tabs{height:38px;width:142px;flex:none;display:flex;background:#7c7b87;border-radius:24px;padding:4px;margin-left:5px}\n.top-tabs button{flex:1;background:transparent;border-radius:22px;color:#303039;font-size:16px;padding:0}\n.top-tabs button.active{background:#565660;color:white}\n.wallet{margin-left:5px;height:26px;width:78px;flex:none;border:1px solid #aba9b3;border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px}\n.wallet strong{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:600}\n.diamond{width:19px;height:19px;display:block;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 2px #4447)}\n.rules-button{position:absolute;right:0;top:86px;width:19px;min-height:60px;padding:5px 3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#9d99a3,#88848e);border:1px solid #b0aab4;border-right:0;border-radius:9px 0 0 9px;font-size:11px;color:#fff;line-height:13px;white-space:normal;z-index:2}\n.machine{position:relative;width:326px;height:532px;margin:31px auto 0;padding:16px 12px 20px;border-radius:39px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f6c1da 0%,#edaccd 5%,#e9adcb 50%,#e8aac9 95%,#bf86a5 100%);box-shadow:inset 4px 5px 8px #ffe2f2,inset -4px -5px 9px #bd81a0,0 16px 16px -11px #493c4b99}\n.machine:before,.machine:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:-13px;width:31px;height:17px;border-radius:0 0 6px 6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#be87a5,#d99cba 70%,#a87594);box-shadow:0 7px 9px #64505e44;z-index:0}\n.machine:before{left:56px}.machine:after{right:56px}\n.machine-header{height:35px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding-left:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.announcement{height:35px;width:200px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:5px 10px 5px 12px;border:1px solid #f1b6d5;border-radius:22px;background:#f9d1e6;box-shadow:inset 1px 2px 3px #bf819f8c}\n.announcement-text{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#70465e;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.35px}\n.avatar{width:21px;height:22px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #fff;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(#82c6e2,#284776);display:grid;place-items:center}\n.avatar svg{width:18px;height:18px}\n.mini-tool{width:32px;height:35px;padding:3px 0 0;flex:none;border-radius:50%;color:#a45f83;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#f8d1e5 35%,#efb4d0 70%);box-shadow:inset 1px 2px 2px #b97c9b66;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column}\n.mini-tool svg{width:21px;height:21px}\n.mini-tool span{font-size:10px;line-height:11px;background:linear-gradient(#ffe9f4,#efb2d0);border-radius:6px;padding:0 4px;color:#74435e;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #a6688b66}\n.machine-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:212px 80px;gap:8px}\n.prize-window{width:212px;height:383px;border:10px solid #ffd4ec;border-radius:34px;padding:23px 11px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,52px);grid-auto-rows:69px;gap:12px 7px;align-content:start;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#b7bacb,#bfc0ce 60%,#b5b7c9);box-shadow:0 -5px 3px #ca81a5,inset 0 0 13px #edb4d5,0 1px 0 #fbd2e7}\n.prize-card{position:relative;width:52px;height:69px;border:3px solid #f1f2ef;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#3374aa,#4194b9);box-shadow:2px 3px 1px #858988,3px 5px 3px #6a62685c;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;padding-top:2px}\n.prize-card:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;left:17px;width:12px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;background:#dddeda;box-shadow:0 1px 1px #3f5f73;z-index:2}\n.artwork{height:46px;width:40px;aspect-ratio:40/46;flex:none;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%,#80cfec99,transparent 68%),linear-gradient(105deg,#13537c55,#85d7ec44);display:grid;place-items:center}\n.artwork svg{width:38px;height:45px;opacity:.87}\n.artwork.purple{background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#d7c2f0,#796bb2)}\n.artwork.gold{background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#f4dc92,#c48b37)}\n.prize-name{height:11px;line-height:11px;flex:none;text-align:center;background:#55b7d9;color:#06202d;border-radius:2px;width:40px;max-width:100%;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.3px;z-index:1}\n.outlet{height:58px;margin:8px 6px 0;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #d48aaa;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#a55b80,#bd729a 65%,#c982a7);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 4px #9b557c}\n.outlet:after{content:\"\";display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 64%,#ffffff0c 64%,#ffffff0c 72%,transparent 72%,transparent 78%,#ffffff08 78%,#ffffff08 82%,transparent 82%)}\n.side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}\n.draw-tabs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;width:80px}\n.draw-tab{height:30px;width:77px;margin:auto;padding:0;border-radius:18px;color:#95617b;backg