ng-archer\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51417\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51417\">已拥有<small>★★★</small></span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-name\" data-wf-id=\"name-zhang-archer\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51419\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51419\"><span class=\"footer-rarity\" data-wf-id=\"secondary-rarity-zhang-archer\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51418\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51418\">典藏</span>张起灵</h2>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"character-card epic\" data-wf-id=\"card-liubang\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"51420\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51420\">\n        <div class=\"character-stage\" data-wf-id=\"stage-liubang\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-stage-liubang\">\n          <span class=\"rarity epic-label\" data-wf-id=\"rarity-liubang\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51421\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51421\">典藏</span>\n          <div class=\"artwork\" data-wf-id=\"art-liubang\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"51422\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"刘邦-黑金长袍\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"刘邦黑金长袍形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细国风游戏Q版男性全身立绘，青年刘邦，黑色微卷蓬松短发，发顶有翘起发束，白皙肤色、清秀五官、灰黑色大眼睛、淡然表情，身穿黑色缎面交领长袍，衣襟袖口有细密金线纹样，暗红内衬和红色腰带，银色腰链及佩饰，肩后横持一柄黑银长剑，另一手自然垂落，站立三分之四正面，黑金与暗红配色，衣服层次丰富，透明背景完整全身，无文字无卡框无按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-e51422\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n            <svg data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" width=\"104\" height=\"133\" viewBox=\"0 0 104 133\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2506-node-2\" data-wf-role=\"icon\">\n              <defs><linearGradient id=\"liu-robe\" x1=\"34\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"128\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#45444a\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#171b24\"></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"liu-hair\" x1=\"35\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"50\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#758084\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#20252c\"></stop></linear