per-new-locked\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-element-id=\"51744\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51744\">\n          <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-label=\"未解锁\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-node-1\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><path d=\"M6.5 10V7a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0v3\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" /><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#66717b\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"new-badge\" data-wf-id=\"badge-new-wallpaper\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51745\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51745\">NEW</span>\n        <span class=\"caption\" data-wf-id=\"text-wallpaper-new\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51746\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51746\">青莲剑仙</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"wallpaper locked\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"card-wallpaper-sword-immortal\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"51747\" data-wf-feedback=\"该照片壁纸尚未解锁\" aria-label=\"青莲剑仙，白衣壁纸，未解锁\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51747\">\n        <div class=\"thumb\" data-wf-id=\"image-wallpaper-sword-immortal\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"51748\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"青莲剑仙-白衣御剑\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"青莲剑仙白衣御剑形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细国风仙侠游戏全身角色立绘，年轻成年男性仙人，清秀俊美面容，黑色长发以银色发冠高束，长发向右飘动，白色与浅灰蓝丝绸广袖长袍，深蓝刺绣腰封、银色纹饰，长袖和衣摆有流动层次，持一柄清透青色仙剑，身体正面略侧站立，冷静从容，白蓝灰主色，精致布料褶皱及柔和明暗，完整全身竖幅构图，透明背景，不含文字、按钮和卡框。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51748\">\n          <div class=\"art-placeholder\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mw24qima-2\"><span data-wf-id=\"text-sword-immortal-fallback\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-text-sword-immortal-fallback\">白衣御剑</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"lock\" data-wf-id=\"icon-wallpaper-sword-locked\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-element-id=\"51749\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51749\">\n          <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-label=\"未解锁\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-node-2\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><path d=\"M6.5 10V7a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0v3\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" /><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#66717b\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"caption\" data-wf-id=\"text-wallpaper-sword-immortal\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51750\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51750\">青莲剑仙</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"wallpaper locked\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"card-wallpaper-flower-spirit\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"51751\" data-wf-feedback=\"该照片壁纸尚未解锁\" aria-label=\"青莲剑仙，花灵壁纸，未解锁\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51751\">\n        <div class=\"thumb\" data-wf-id=\"image-wallpaper-flower-spirit\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"51752\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"花灵少女-青翠花杖\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"花灵少女青翠花杖形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细东方奇幻游戏成年女性全身立绘，深棕色长发自然飞扬，发侧点缀青绿花饰，面容明艳温柔，青绿色与浅白色轻纱短裙，肩部和腰间装饰橙金色花朵，轻盈半透明飘带，赤足或精致细带凉鞋，一手向外舒展，另一手举起顶端盛开金黄色花朵的花杖，修长优雅站姿，青绿、白、橙金色主调，细致服装材质与柔和明暗，竖幅完整全身构图，透明背景，不含文字、按钮或卡框。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51752\">\n          <div class=\"art-placeholder\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mw24qima-1\"><span data-wf-id=\"text-flower-spirit-fallback\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-text-flower-spirit-fallback\">青翠花灵</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"lock\" data-wf-id=\"icon-wallpaper-flower-locked\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-element-id=\"51753\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-e51753\">\n          <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-label=\"未解锁\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2515-node-3\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><path d=\"M6.5 10V7a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0v3\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" /><rect x=\"3