=\"51826\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2519-e51826\">诛仙</h1>\n        <p class=\"period\" data-wf-id=\"text-offer-period\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"51827\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2519-e51827\"><strong>限时特价：</strong>11月27日-11月29日</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"stage\" data-wf-id=\"character-visual-stage\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2519-character-visual-stage\">\n        <div class=\"artwork\" data-wf-id=\"artwork-luxueqi\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"51828\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"陆雪琪-典藏白衣\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"陆雪琪典藏白衣形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细高品质中国仙侠游戏3D写实角色立绘，诛仙陆雪琪典藏白衣形态，年轻成年女性，清冷精致的东方脸庞，肤色白皙，黑色长直发半束高髻、银白发冠及细长银饰，发丝垂至腰下；身穿仙气飘逸的纯白与极浅冰蓝色多层丝绸长裙，半透明薄纱广袖，银色刺绣护肩和精细银色腰饰，蓝色宝石及流苏，裙摆修长垂至地面。人物正面全身站立，头部略侧，神态沉静，左手轻抬于腰前，右手自然下垂握着带青蓝色穗子的细长仙剑，肩后露出冰蓝剑身。人物占画面高度约90%，置于画面中部偏右，为左侧标签留出空间。身后是巨大柔白月轮、冷蓝色云雾山峦，边缘有纤细竹叶，脚下深蓝岩石与少量青草，清冷蓝白主色，柔和月光、真实材质、细腻面部与服饰层次，竖幅258:409构图。只生成角色和自然背景，不含文字、价格、标签、边框、按钮或水印。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2519-e51828\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"artwork-fallback\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg class=\"character-outline\" width=\"190\" height=\"360\" viewBox=\"0 0 190 360\" fill=\"none\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2519-node-1\" data-wf-role=\"icon\">\n              <defs><linearGradient id=\"robe\" x1=\"35\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"153\" y2=\"350\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#f5fbff\"></stop><stop offset=\".46\" stop-color=\"#dcebf7\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8caec9\"></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"hair\" x1=\"70\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"260\"><stop stop-color=\"#24394f\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#4a657d\"></stop></linearGradient></defs>\n              <path d=\"M73 74Q48 96 47 186l-9 104 41-19 46 25q23-120-2-216Z\" fill=\"url(#hair)\" />\n              <path d=\"m72 81-20 22-22 111 27-10-10 131q50 19 104 0l-32-144 26 35-8-115-28-29Z\" fill=\"url(#robe)\" stroke=\"#e8f6ff\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" />\n   