ack-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-backpack-label\">背包</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-link\" data-wf-id=\"background-mail\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-background-mail\">\n          <span class=\"quick-icon\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"mail-icon\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-mail-icon\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" /><path d=\"m3 6 9 8 9-8\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"mail-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-mail-label\">邮件</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <section class=\"pet-info\" data-wf-id=\"background-pet-info\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-background-pet-info\">\n        <h2 data-wf-id=\"pet-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-pet-name\">奶龙</h2>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"pet-mood\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-pet-mood\">心情：90%</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"pet-health\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-pet-health\">健康：88%</p>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"change-pet\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-nav=\"更换耀宝页\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-change-pet\">切换耀宝</button>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n    <div data-wf-chrome-spacer=\"navigation\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"overlay\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-overlay\" data-wf-role=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"promotion-title\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-promotion-overlay\">\n    <article class=\"announcement-card\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-card\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52539\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-e52539\">\n      <header class=\"promo-header\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-header\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-promotion-header\">\n        <div class=\"headline-row\">\n          <svg class=\"new-gem\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-gold\" data-wf-role=\"image\" width=\"21\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-promotion-gold\">\n            <path d=\"m3 10 7-7 10 1 6 10-7 9-13-3-4-6Z\" fill=\"#ffcc00\" />\n            <path d=\"m3 10 9 1-2-8Zm9 1 8-7 6 10-10 1Z\" fill=\"#fff574\" />\n            <path d=\"m3 10 3 10 10-5-4-4Zm13 5 3 8 7-9Z\" fill=\"#ffb200\" />\n            <path d=\"m9 5 2 4m7-3-3 5M5 13l4 1\" stroke=\"#fffbc3\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n          <h2 id=\"promotion-title\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-title\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52540\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-e52540\">新品耀宝</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\" data-wf-id=\"promotion-subtitle\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52541\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-e52541\">萌系耀宝正式推出上线</p>\n        <img class=\"header-character\" data-wf-id=\"orange-girl-art\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52542\" src=\"/api/assets/artwork/182/6b92ab51e1d1c70c4aa1c51f682056a7c679936ccd46b5b538ca44f13797990f.png\" alt=\"橘帽白手套橙子少女\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-e52542\">\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"promo-content\">\n        <div class=\"character-art\" data-wf-id=\"virgo-cat-art\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52543\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"处女座猫咪-橙心星牌\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"处女座橙心猫咪星座徽章\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二维游戏宠物收藏插画，透明背景，竖版242:338构图。完整展示一枚华丽的处女座猫咪星座徽章，不含卡框、界面文字、按钮。中心是奶油浅黄色脸的可爱拟人猫咪，圆润大头，巨大紫红宝石眼睛和心形瞳孔高光，粉红鼻尖，小嘴微笑，白色细胡须；蓬松蜜桃橙色卷发，额前一颗大橙色心形卷刘海，两侧垂落卷发，深灰猫耳配浅青色蝴蝶结与薄荷珠饰。穿浅青色褶边领、灰色猫爪手套和宽大灰色靴子，领口银色圆铃铛，坐姿正面抱着一颗橙色切面爱心宝石，灰色斑纹长尾巴卷在右侧。坐在珊瑚橙色软垫上。周围是完整的薄荷青、浅黄与珊瑚粉复古星座圆拱装饰，顶部宽大拱形冠，边框镶嵌菱形晶石，底部橙粉色圆形星盘与多枚黄色吊坠，点缀奶黄色闪光与蝴蝶。精细深灰紫描边，赛璐璐平涂和柔和高光，橙色、薄荷青、奶油黄为主色，所有轮廓完整留在画面内，精致丰富而清晰的原创游戏宠物美术质感。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-e52543\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n          <svg data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" data-wf-id=\"virgo-cat-fallback\" data-wf-role=\"image\" width=\"242\" height=\"338\" viewBox=\"0 0 242 338\" fill=\"none\" aria-label=\"橙心猫咪星座徽章插画预览\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2520-virgo-cat-fallback\">\n            <defs>\n              <linearGradient id=\"rim\" x1=\"20\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"310\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#fff6a5\" /><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#93ded8\" /><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffbd97\" /></linearGradient>\n              <linearGradient id=\"peach\" x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"228\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#ffd7ab\" /><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ff9b75\" /></linearGradient>\n            </defs>\n            <ellipse cx=\"121\" cy=\"169\" rx=\"116\" ry=\"145\" fill=\"url(#rim)\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"121\" cy=\"166\" rx=\"104\" ry=\"130\" fill=\"#fff1c7\" stroke=\"#7dcacb\" stroke-width=\"7\" />\n            <path d=\"M20 68Q121-16 222 68l-12 25Q121 25 32 93Z\" fill=\"#a8e3df\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <text x=\"121\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff8c0\" stroke=\"#d48d6b\" stroke-width=\".8\" font-size=\"21\" letter-spacing=\"6\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">VIRGO</text>\n            <path d=\"M40 110 28 74l43 13m103 0 42-13-12 39\" fill=\"#777586\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"3\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"121\" cy=\"247\" rx=\"91\" ry=\"47\" fill=\"#ffab7f\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <path d=\"M175 268c54 11 45-55 10-56 20 25 11 37-12 25\" fill=\"#8f8d98\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"3\" />\n            <path d=\"M58 198q-31-10-30-40 1-78 93-77 94 0 94 77 0 31-31 40l-18-23H77Z\" fill=\"url(#peach)\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"121\" cy=\"167\" rx=\"64\" ry=\"48\" fill=\"#fff7c5\" stroke=\"#656079\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n            <path d=\"M58 144q3-40 29-45c-16-28 13-48 32-20 26-17 52 11 29 29 24-10 42 11 37 35-26 15-45 9-55-4-1