lass=\"garden\">\n      <div class=\"trunk\"></div>\n      <div class=\"canopy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"promotion-stack\">\n        <div class=\"cat-promotion\">\n          <img data-wf-id=\"background-cat-offer-image\" data-wf-role=\"image\" src=\"/api/assets/artwork/182/25b45646c75df20669ac0fdc5f70af904759a8c0b0a46270b8ec268b4343b304.png\" alt=\"招财猫\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-cat-offer-image\">\n          <span class=\"promo-label\" data-wf-id=\"background-cat-offer-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-cat-offer-label\">上新低价</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gift-promotion\">\n          <svg data-wf-id=\"background-gift-offer-icon\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"37\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-gift-offer-icon\"><path d=\"M4 10h16v12H4Z\" fill=\"#8c82e8\" /><path d=\"M2 7h20v5H2Z\" fill=\"#b299f2\" /><path d=\"M12 7v15M12 7C3 8 3 0 7 2l5 5Zm0 0c9 1 9-7 5-5l-5 5Z\" stroke=\"#e2c6ff\" /></svg>\n          <span class=\"promo-label\" data-wf-id=\"background-gift-offer-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-gift-offer-label\">首单特价</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"reward-row\">\n        <div class=\"reward\">\n          <div class=\"bubble\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"background-gift-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-gift-diamond\"><path d=\"M6 2h12l4 10-10 11L2 12Z\" fill=\"#1967e9\" stroke=\"none\" /><path d=\"m6 2 6 7 6-7ZM2 12l10-3L6 2Z\" fill=\"#74d2ff\" stroke=\"none\" /><path d=\"m12 9 10 3-10 11Z\" fill=\"#0099ed\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"reward-label\" data-wf-id=\"background-gift-reward-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-gift-reward-label\">送个礼物</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"reward raised\">\n          <div class=\"bubble\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"background-download-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"28\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-download-diamond\"><path d=\"M6 2h12l4 10-10 11L2 12Z\" fill=\"#1967e9\" stroke=\"none\" /><path d=\"m6 2 6 7 6-7ZM2 12l10-3L6 2Z\" fill=\"#74d2ff\" stroke=\"none\" /><path d=\"m12 9 10 3-10 11Z\" fill=\"#0099ed\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"reward-label\" data-wf-id=\"background-download-reward-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-download-reward-label\">下载完成<br>领取奖励</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"reward\">\n          <div class=\"bubble\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"background-download-energy\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-download-energy\"><path d=\"M8 2h11l-5 8h7L10 23l2-10H4Z\" fill=\"#ffd963\" stroke=\"none\" /><path d=\"m14 10 7 0-11 13 6-13Z\" fill=\"#ff983c\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"reward-label\" data-wf-id=\"background-energy-reward-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-energy-reward-label\">下载完成<br>领取奖励</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"quick-tools\">\n        <div class=\"quick-tool\">\n          <div class=\"quick-circle\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"background-month-card-icon\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-month-card-icon\"><path d=\"m3 7 4 4 5-8 5 8 4-4-3 13H6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M7 23h10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /></svg>\n            <span class=\"notification\" data-wf-id=\"background-month-notification\" data-wf-role=\"text\" style=\"min-width:6px;width:6px;height:6px;padding:0;right:2px;top:4px\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-month-notification\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"background-month-card-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-month-card-label\">月卡</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-tool\">\n          <div class=\"quick-circle\">\n            <svg data-wf-id=\"background-backpack-icon\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-backpack-icon\"><path d=\"M8 6V4h8v2M3 8h18v13H3Z\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M3 12q9 4 18 0M12 12v5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" /></svg>\n            <span class=\"notification\" data-wf-id=\"background-backpack-count\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-backpack-count\">2</span>\n          </div>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"background-backpack-label\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-background-backpack-label\">背包</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"garden-floor\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"backdrop\" data-wf-id=\"instructions-backdrop\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-instructions-backdrop\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog-layout\">\n    <section class=\"dialog-card\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"instructions-title\" data-wf-id=\"card-adventure-instructions\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52546\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52546\">\n      <h2 class=\"dialog-title\" id=\"instructions-title\" data-wf-id=\"text-instructions-title\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52547\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52547\">探险与属性说明</h2>\n      <div class=\"rules\" data-wf-id=\"instructions-content\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-instructions-content\">\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-start\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52548\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52548\">1. 每天7:00所有精灵需点击1次\"开始探险\"才自动消耗能量探险；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-energy\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52549\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52549\">2. 能量主要通过\"任务\"里做任务获得，养成中的精灵自动扣除能量进行探险，每次扣5点能量。每晚的23:00-7:00期间不能探险，要好好休息哦；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-rewards\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52550\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52550\">3. 探险可以获得钻石和装扮物掉落，钻石可以抽奖获得精灵或碎片，装扮掉落可以激活互动壁纸、照片和纪念品，探险还可以获得额外的钻石奖励，获得额外的钻石奖励时精灵播抱钻石动画，点击精灵可领取；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-attributes\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52551\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52551\">4. 体力、心情、健康=0时精灵处于异常状态，影响探险的效率，生病会停止探险；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-feeding\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52552\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52552\">5. 领取每日宝箱获取投喂材料，成功投喂有钻石奖励，钻石数量=（实际增加的饥饿、心情和健康值）/10；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-diamond-limit\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52553\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52553\">6. 非月卡状态下钻石堆叠上限是300个，月卡状态下根据月卡等级钻石堆叠上限最高1000个；</p>\n        <p data-wf-id=\"text-rule-month-card\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52554\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52554\">7. 月卡可以加速探险（快速掉落钻石和装扮物）。</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"confirm\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-instructions-understood\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52555\" data-action=\"back\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2526-e52555\">知道了</button>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<div id=\"wf-prototype-feedback\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><script data-wf-controls-runtime=\"1\">(function () {\n  if (window.__wfControls) { window.__wfControls.normalize(); return; }\n  var selector = \'[data-wf-control],[role=\"switch\"],.wf-sw,[data-wf-toggle],input[type=\"checkbox\"],input[type=\"radio\"]\';\n  function editing() { return !!document.querySelector(\'script[data-wf-inject]\') && !document.body.classList.co