et-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52143\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-e52143\">奶龙</h2>\n        <span class=\"corner-badge resident-badge\" data-wf-id=\"badge-resident\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52144\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-e52144\">入住中</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"pet-card\" data-wf-id=\"card-tushan-honghong\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52145\" data-wf-search-text=\"涂山红红\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-e52145\">\n        <div class=\"art\" data-wf-id=\"image-tushan-honghong\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52146\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"涂山红红-经典红衣\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"涂山红红经典红衣形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏角色立绘，女性狐妖涂山红红，金橙色及腰长直发，顶部一缕翘起的呆毛，两侧毛茸茸的浅棕色狐耳，白皙鹅蛋脸，翠绿色眼睛，神情温柔而自信。身穿深红色丝绸交领无袖露肩长裙，白色细滚边，红色宽袖垂落于手臂，肩部金色小饰件，无武器，正面自然站姿，上半身到腰部构图，头部与狐耳完整呈现，金橙和绯红主色，细腻发丝与柔和赛璐璐明暗，透明背景，无文字无卡框无按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-e52146\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n          <svg class=\"fallback-art\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 85 93\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-node-6\" data-wf-role=\"icon\">\n            <path d=\"M20 43 10 36 24 22 33 20 49 20 61 24 76 37 63 42 67 93H18Z\" fill=\"#e6b462\" opacity=\".65\" />\n            <path d=\"M24 36Q18 7 42 7T62 39L63 88H22Z\" fill=\"#f6cb77\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"43\" cy=\"35\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"19\" fill=\"#fff0de\" />\n            <path d=\"M26 33Q27 9 45 12L57 28 44 22 36 34 38 23Z\" fill=\"#efb846\" />\n            <path d=\"M20 93 25 65 36 56 43 66 50 56 62 66 68 93Z\" fill=\"#b83052\" />\n            <path d=\"m36 56 7 10 7-10-7 23Z\" fill=\"#ffe8d9\" />\n          </svg>\n        <img src=\"/api/assets/artwork/182/481b4d88989dc6b0847babd32b467b1353c02ab747dd0cfc3afd93a152d3d56b.png\" alt=\"涂山红红经典红衣形态\" data-wf-artwork-image=\"true\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2531-e52146-artwork\"></div>\n        <h2 class=\"pet-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-tushan-honghong-name\" data-wf-r