role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52654\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52654\">灵异奇谭</span>\n          <span class=\"art art-blue\" data-wf-id=\"art-blue-gunner-three\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52655\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"灵异奇谭-蓝瞳枪手-蓝黑战术装\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"灵异奇谭蓝瞳枪手蓝黑战术装\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细手游Q版女性全身立绘，黑棕长发、侧编发和松软刘海，蓝色大眼睛、白皙小圆脸、活泼微笑。蓝白短战术上衣、黑超短裤、单侧腿带、深灰高筒战术靴与银色护甲，双手胸前抱深灰现代步枪，枪口斜向右下，三头身侧身站立，蓝黑白主色，精细赛璐璐明暗，完整全身透明背景，无文字卡框按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52655\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\"><span class=\"art-name\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgqwi7-4\">蓝瞳枪手</span><img src=\"/api/assets/artwork/184/446887f4e167cd6f2f11a2acf9e7aceaf1dc6c804d2737daae39ebbe37f28787.png\" alt=\"灵异奇谭蓝瞳枪手蓝黑战术装\" data-wf-artwork-image=\"true\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52655-artwork\"></span>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"empty-slot\" data-wf-id=\"slot-spirit-three\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52656\" aria-label=\"未收集角色卡槽\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52656\"></div>\n        <div class=\"empty-slot\" data-wf-id=\"slot-spirit-four\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52657\" aria-label=\"未收集角色卡槽\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52657\"></div>\n        <div class=\"empty-slot\" data-wf-id=\"slot-spirit-five\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52658\" aria-label=\"未收集角色卡槽\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52658\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"reward\" data-wf-id=\"card-reward-spirit-locked\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52659\" aria-label=\"待解锁收藏奖励\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2595-e52659\"><span class=\"reward-ghost\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgqwi6-3\"></span></div>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <div data-wf-chrome-spacer=\"navigation\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgqwi6-1\"></div><nav class=\"bottom-nav\" data-wf-id=\"bottom-navigation\" data-wf-role=\"navigation-bar\" data-wf-navigation=\"bar\" data-wf-chrome=\"bottom-navigation\" aria-label=\"主导