9 18l6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rail\">\n        <article class=\"product\" data-wf-search-text=\"神秘角色 即将上线\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgs8jk-24\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\" data-wf-id=\"card-mystery\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52686\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52686\">\n            <span class=\"series-label\" data-wf-id=\"text-mystery-series\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52687\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52687\">????</span>\n            <div class=\"art mystery-art\" data-wf-id=\"art-mystery\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52688\" aria-label=\"未揭晓角色剪影\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52688\">\n              <svg width=\"86\" height=\"112\" viewBox=\"0 0 86 112\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-node-1\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><path d=\"m29 20-1-17 8 14q10-5 20 0l7-15-2 20 5 7-5 1 1 9-4-2q1 12-3 17l2 10 12 6 8 19 8 23H2l9-27 8-15 13-7 1-9q-5-7-5-16l-5 2 3-11-4-4z\" fill=\"#2d3067\"></path><path d=\"M31 43q-7 20-9 48l-7 21h18l4-46M55 43q7 20 7 46l7 23H51l-3-45\" fill=\"#2d3067\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"coming\" data-wf-id=\"text-coming-soon\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52689\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52689\">即将上线</span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"product-action\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"button-reserve-mystery\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52690\" data-wf-feedback=\"已选择一元预定，角色即将上线\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52690\">一元预定</button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product\" data-wf-search-text=\"石昊 完美世界 灵动\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgs8jk-21\">\n          <div class=\"product-card green\" data-wf-id=\"card-new-agile\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52691\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52691\">\n            <span class=\"series-label\" data-wf-id=\"text-new-agile-series\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52692\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52692\">完美世界</span>\n            <span class=\"rarity green-label\" data-wf-id=\"badge-agile\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52693\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52693\">灵动</span>\n            <div class=\"art\" data-wf-id=\"art-new-agile\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52694\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"石昊-银发蓝金礼装\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"石昊银发蓝金礼装\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元手游角色半身偏全身立绘，名为石昊的中性俊美少年，白皙精致脸庞，明亮蓝色大眼，微笑张口，银白色长发带浅蓝阴影，刘海蓬松卷曲，长发披散至腰部。头戴小型深蓝礼帽，银色水滴冠饰。穿深蓝色燕尾礼服、白色荷叶领衬衫、金色繁复胸针与肩饰、蓝色宝石领结，白色短裤及深色腿环，腰侧挂蓝金水滴形饰物。正面略侧身，一手向右伸展，一手靠近胸前，活泼优雅。背景为浅灰石柱与金色圆形机械纹饰，主色银白、皇家蓝、浅蓝和金色，精致赛璐璐光影与高密度服饰细节，竖幅3:4构图，人物占画面九成，完整呈现头部到大腿，不含文字、卡框、按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52694\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\"><span data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgs8jk-23\">石昊</span><img src=\"/api/assets/artwork/184/fb433583c673c583b38d71bb6bd74709e9d876def4ae347438d697ffec062517.png\" alt=\"石昊银发蓝金礼装\" data-wf-artwork-image=\"true\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52694-artwork\"></div>\n            <span class=\"product-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-new-agile-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52695\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52695\">石昊</span>\n            <div class=\"price-line\"><span class=\"price\" data-wf-id=\"text-new-agile-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52696\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52696\">优惠价 <b data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgs8jk-22\">¥28.8</b></span><s class=\"old-price\" data-wf-id=\"text-new-agile-old-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52697\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52697\">¥78.8</s></div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"product-action\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"button-claim-agile\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52698\" data-wf-feedback=\"已选择免费领取石昊\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2596-e52698\">免费领取</button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"product\" data-wf-search-text=\"石昊 完美世界 轻盈\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbgs8jk-18\">\n          <div class=\"product-card blue\" data-wf-id=\"ca