快捷操作\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mmb-2\">\n    <div class=\"growth-grid\">\n      <article class=\"character-card large\" data-wf-id=\"card-dragon-chenchen\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52767\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52767\">\n        <span class=\"resident\" data-wf-id=\"badge-desktop-resident\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52768\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52768\">桌面入住中</span>\n        <div class=\"counter\" data-wf-id=\"counter-dragon\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52769\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52769\">\n          <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-id=\"icon-dragon-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-icon-dragon-diamond\"><path d=\"m12 2 9 6-2 12-10 2-7-9 3-8z\" fill=\"#4176e8\" stroke=\"#c4f6ff\" stroke-width=\".6\"></path><path d=\"m12 2-3 9L5 5zm-3 9 10 9L2 13zm0 0 12-3-9-6z\" fill=\"#6ee6ff\" stroke=\"none\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 10 9 2-12z\" fill=\"#1751c3\" stroke=\"none\"></path></svg>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"text-dragon-earned\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-text-dragon-earned\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"large-stage\">\n          <div class=\"character-art\" data-wf-id=\"art-dragon-chenchen\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52770\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"龙女辰辰-红衣青发灵动形态\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"龙女辰辰红衣青发灵动形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏Q版全身角色，女性龙族少女龙女辰辰，大头小身体，浅青蓝色长发，头顶盘起蓬松发髻并配小巧青色龙形发饰，两侧圆形银饰，额头红色花钿，大而清澈的蓝眼睛，白皙皮肤，温柔自信微笑。穿红色宽袖古风外袍，金色滚边与红色胸前蝴蝶结，内搭浅蓝色交领短裙和深青色腰带，浅色绣鞋。右手握一柄银色短剑斜向身侧，另一只手自然伸出，身体微侧而正面看向观众。头发丝、衣料褶皱、金属剑刃有细腻明暗高光，青蓝与朱红主色，脚下很淡的椭圆接地阴影，人物完整居中，透明背景，不含文字、按钮、卡片、边框。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52770\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n            <div data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\">\n              <svg class=\"fallback-art\" width=\"105\" height=\"184\" viewBox=\"0 0 105 184\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-node-1\" data-wf-role=\