ta-wf-element-id=\"52773\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52773\">探险中...</p>\n          <div class=\"stat\" data-wf-id=\"text-dragon-outfit\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52774\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52774\"><span class=\"stat-label\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-14\">装扮:</span><span class=\"stat-value\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-13\">20/40</span><span class=\"notification\" data-wf-id=\"badge-dragon-outfit-notice\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52775\" aria-label=\"有新装扮\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52775\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"swap\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-swap-dragon\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52776\" data-nav=\"5/角色切换\" aria-label=\"更换龙女辰辰\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52776\">换</button>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"character-card\" data-wf-id=\"card-yumi\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52777\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52777\">\n        <div class=\"counter\" data-wf-id=\"counter-yumi\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52778\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52778\" style=\"z-index: 2 !important;\">\n          <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-id=\"icon-yumi-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-icon-yumi-diamond\"><path d=\"m12 2 9 6-2 12-10 2-7-9 3-8z\" fill=\"#4176e8\" stroke=\"#c4f6ff\" stroke-width=\".6\"></path><path d=\"m12 2-3 9L5 5zm-3 9 10 9L2 13zm0 0 12-3-9-6z\" fill=\"#6ee6ff\" stroke=\"none\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 10 9 2-12z\" fill=\"#1751c3\" stroke=\"none\"></path></svg>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"text-yumi-earned\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-text-yumi-earned\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"character-art small-art\" data-wf-id=\"art-yumi\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52779\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"悠米-双丸子耳机黑白短裙\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"悠米双丸子耳机黑白短裙\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏Q版女性少女悠米，全身，大头小身体，奶茶浅棕金色长发，两侧高双丸子发髻，散落长发及轻盈刘海，圆润可爱的脸，金棕色大眼睛，白皙皮肤，开朗微笑。佩戴蓝紫色包耳式电竞耳机和嘴边麦克风，发髻旁黑色小蝴蝶结。身穿黑白相间露肩短款连衣裙，黑色领口、白色裙摆、胸前大黑蝴蝶结，纤细手臂自然张开，一腿支撑另一腿俏皮抬起，白袜与黑色圆头玛丽珍鞋。暖棕发色、黑白服装与蓝紫耳机，精细发丝和布料明暗，人物完整居中，脚下浅灰蓝椭圆阴影，透明背景，无文字、卡框和按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52779\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\" style=\"z-index: 4 !important;\">\n          <div data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\" style=\"z-index: 1 !important;\">\n            <svg class=\"fallback-art\" width=\"89\" height=\"116\" viewBox=\"0 0 89 116\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-node-2\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><ellipse cx=\"47\" cy=\"111\" rx=\"23\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#b7c9d7\" opacity=\".45\"></ellipse><path d=\"M22 27c-12-17 6-28 15-14m20 0c10-14 27-2 14 14M23 51C9 17 34 12 46 17c23-4 36 18 23 39M24 44l-4 40m49-40 5 40\" stroke=\"#c6b29f\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path><path d=\"M27 46c0 15 9 24 19 24s20-10 20-24M35 74l-9 23 21 5 18-6-9-23m-19 29-3 8m20-8 7 7\" stroke=\"#aaa0b9\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></path></svg>\n            <span class=\"art-name\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-11\">悠米</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"character-info small-info\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-8\" style=\"z-index: 1 !important;\">\n          <h2 class=\"character-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-yumi-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52780\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52780\">悠米</h2>\n          <p class=\"exploring\" data-wf-id=\"text-yumi-exploring\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52781\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52781\">探险中...</p>\n          <div class=\"stat affection\" data-wf-id=\"text-yumi-affection\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52782\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52782\"><span class=\"stat-label\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-10\">好感:</span><span class=\"stat-value\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi7mme-9\">LV03</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"swap\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-swap-yumi\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52783\" data-nav=\"5/角色切换\" aria-label=\"更换悠米\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52783\" style=\"z-index: 3 !important;\">换</button>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"character-card\" data-wf-id=\"card-tushan-honghong\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52784\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52784\">\n        <div class=\"counter\" data-wf-id=\"counter-honghong\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52785\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52785\">\n          <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-id=\"icon-honghong-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-icon-honghong-diamond\"><path d=\"m12 2 9 6-2 12-10 2-7-9 3-8z\" fill=\"#4176e8\" stroke=\"#c4f6ff\" stroke-width=\".6\"></path><path d=\"m12 2-3 9L5 5zm-3 9 10 9L2 13zm0 0 12-3-9-6z\" fill=\"#6ee6ff\" stroke=\"none\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 10 9 2-12z\" fill=\"#1751c3\" stroke=\"none\"></path></svg>\n          <span data-wf-id=\"text-honghong-earned\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-text-honghong-earned\">0</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"character-art small-art fox-art\" data-wf-id=\"art-tushan-honghong\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52786\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"涂山红红-金发红衣狐妖形态\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"涂山红红金发红衣狐妖形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏Q版狐妖少女涂山红红，全身大头小身体，明亮金橙色长发和头顶翘起的一缕呆毛，两侧蓬松橙金色狐狸耳朵，翠绿色大眼睛，白皙脸颊，俏皮自信微笑。身穿红色古风短裙与宽袖短外衣，白色内襟、粉白袖口、金色滚边、腰间金色束带和细小铃铛装饰，赤足穿红金色细带凉鞋。双臂展开，身体向左前方轻盈跃起，一腿向前另一腿弯曲向后，金橙色蓬松狐尾向右侧舒展，发梢与裙摆飘动。金橙、朱红、翠绿主色，精细游戏立绘质感，柔和高光与清晰暗部层次，完整角色居中，脚下浅蓝灰椭圆阴影，透明背景，不含文字、边框和按钮。\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-e52786\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n          <div data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\">\n            <svg class=\"fallback-art\" width=\"89\" height=\"116\" viewBox=\"0 0 89 116\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2597-node-3\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><ellipse cx=\"45\" cy=\"111\" rx=\"23\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#b7c9d7\" opacity=\".45\"></ellipse><path d=\"m23 37-8-21 19 10M59 2