"text-dragon-exploring\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52855\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52855\">探险中...</p>\n            <span class=\"costume\" data-wf-id=\"badge-dragon-costumes\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52856\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52856\"><span class=\"costume-label\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84ce-28\">装扮:</span><span class=\"costume-value\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84ce-27\">20/40</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"swap\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-swap-dragon\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52857\" data-nav=\"5/角色切换\" aria-label=\"更换龙女辰辰\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52857\">换</button>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"slot slot-sick\">\n        <article class=\"character-card abnormal\" data-wf-id=\"card-sick-swordsman\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52858\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52858\">\n          <div class=\"scene\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84cd-25\">\n            <div class=\"artwork artwork-sick\" data-wf-id=\"art-sick-swordsman\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52860\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"黑衣剑客-生病坐姿\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"黑衣剑客生病坐姿\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏Q版男性黑衣剑客全身立绘，长黑发高马尾，红色发绳和细长红飘带，苍白肤色，脸颊微红，眼睛呈眩晕螺旋状，黑灰交领织物长袍配暗红领口腰带，灰黑长靴，双手无力垂落，抱膝坐地身体微微向左倾，头顶淡金色环形小星星表现生病眩晕，深灰黑与暗红主色，有细腻发丝和服装明暗层次，三头身大头小身体，透明背景，完整角色，不含文字按钮卡框或气泡\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52860\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"artwork-fallback\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"88\" height=\"94\" viewBox=\"0 0 88 94\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-node-1\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><ellipse cx=\"47\" cy=\"89\" rx=\"29\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#a6b9c6\"></ellipse><path d=\"M53 7Q75 3 75 31L78 75 58 69 47 24Z\" fill=\"#343640\"></path><path d=\"M25 51Q12 32 27 17Q44 2 60 22L66 58 55 73 24 66Z\" fill=\"#353641\"></path><path d=\"M34 54Q49 49 59 60L66 84Q44 94 26 82Z\" fill=\"#464650\"></path><path d=\"m37 57 10 14 10-14-10 8z\" fill=\"#b36c73\"></path><ellipse cx=\"43\" cy=\"37\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#e2c6c1\"></ellipse><path d=\"M23 33Q24 7 49 14Q68 18 61 43L51 24 42 31 39 20Z\" fill=\"#363740\"></path><path d=\"m29 39 7-3 2 6-6 2-2-4m16-2 7-2 2 6-6 2-2-4\" stroke=\"#655d64\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M64 25q-2 27 3 55\" stroke=\"#a36774\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"counter\" data-wf-id=\"counter-sick-diamonds\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52859\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52859\">\n            <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-id=\"icon-sick-diamond\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-icon-sick-diamond\"><path d=\"m12 2 9 6-3 12-10 2-6-8 2-8z\" fill=\"#297bea\" stroke=\"#82d6ff\" stroke-width=\".7\"></path><path d=\"m12 2-4 9-4-5zm-4 9 10 9-10 2zm0 0 13-3-9-6z\" fill=\"#9ceaff\" stroke=\"none\"></path></svg>\n            <span class=\"count\" data-wf-id=\"text-sick-diamond-count\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-text-sick-diamond-count\">0</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"thought\" data-wf-id=\"image-sick-thought\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52861\" aria-label=\"发烧体温计\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52861\">\n            <svg width=\"28\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" data-wf-id=\"icon-thermometer\" data-wf-role=\"icon\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-icon-thermometer\"><g transform=\"rotate(-45 12 12)\"><path d=\"M9 15V5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v10a5 5 0 1 1-6 0Z\" fill=\"#f3f5fa\" stroke=\"#9babc4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path d=\"M12 6v11\" stroke=\"#ff6461\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.7\" fill=\"#ff9f32\" stroke=\"#ff6a53\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M14 6h1m-1 3h1m-1 3h1\" stroke=\"#99a2b4\" stroke-width=\".7\"></path></g></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"info\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84cd-24\">\n            <p class=\"status-text\" data-wf-id=\"text-sick-status\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52862\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52862\">状态异常</p>\n            <span class=\"condition\" data-wf-id=\"badge-sick-condition\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52863\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52863\">生病</span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"swap\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-swap-sick\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52864\" aria-label=\"更换生病角色\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52864\" style=\"\">换</button>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"slot slot-sad\">\n        <article class=\"character-card abnormal\" data-wf-id=\"card-sad-fox\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52865\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52865\">\n          <div class=\"scene\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84cd-23\">\n            <div class=\"artwork artwork-sad\" data-wf-id=\"art-sad-fox\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52867\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"金发狐耳少女-红衣沮丧形态\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"金发狐耳少女红衣沮丧形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细游戏Q版女性狐妖全身插画，金黄色长发，厚重长刘海遮住大半张脸，头顶一撮翘起呆毛，两侧大狐狸耳朵外缘橙色耳内粉色，白皙小脸埋在双膝间，穿红色丝绸短裙配金边与浅色袖口，赤足配纤细金色脚环，双腿屈膝并拢坐地，双手抱膝，低头沮丧不开心，蓬松狐尾弯曲在身后，主色金黄与朱红，三头身精致可爱角色，有发丝高光和布料层次，透明背景，不含气泡文字卡框按钮\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52867\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"artwork-fallback\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"91\" height=\"89\" viewBox=\"0 0 91 89\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-node-2\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><ellipse cx=\"49\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"31\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#a6b9c6\"></ellipse><path d=\"M61 63Q86 55 85 74Q83 87 59 81\" fill=\"#e5b75c\"></path><path d=\"m19 31-12 8 9-24 12 10m39 7 14 5-13-23-10 12\" fill=\"#e2a764\"></path><path d=\"M21 58Q9 34 26 17Q46 1 65 19Q80 31 70 65L57 78 27 75Z\" fill=\"#e9bb50\"></path><path d=\"M37 16q1-15