tatus-text\" data-wf-id=\"text-sad-status\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52869\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52869\">状态异常</p>\n            <span class=\"condition\" data-wf-id=\"badge-sad-condition\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52870\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52870\">不开心</span>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"swap\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"btn-swap-sad\" data-wf-role=\"button\" data-wf-element-id=\"52871\" data-nav=\"5/角色切换\" aria-label=\"更换不开心角色\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52871\">换</button>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"slot slot-sparrow\">\n        <span class=\"alert-count\" data-wf-id=\"badge-sparrow-notifications\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"52874\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52874\">16</span>\n        <article class=\"character-card\" data-wf-id=\"card-sparrow\" data-wf-role=\"card\" data-wf-element-id=\"52872\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52872\">\n          <div class=\"scene\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-mwbi84cd-21\" style=\"z-index: 1 !important;\">\n            <div class=\"artwork artwork-sparrow\" data-wf-id=\"art-sparrow\" data-wf-role=\"image\" data-wf-element-id=\"52875\" data-wf-artwork-key=\"雀娘-青白羽衣形态\" data-wf-artwork-name=\"雀娘青白羽衣形态\" data-wf-artwork-prompt=\"精细二次元游戏Q版女性角色雀娘，全身三头身，深黑蓝色长发，发顶白色羽毛花冠与浅金饰件，额间金色菱形蓝宝石额饰，大而明亮的灰紫色眼睛，小巧柔和面部，穿白色与浅青色轻纱羽衣，金色细边与青蓝胸甲，腰间飘逸长纱和羽毛形飘带，纤细手臂自然张开，身体略向左站立，浅青短靴，衣摆向右飘动，青白银金主色，发丝细节和布料高光精致，透明背景，不含文字感叹号卡框按钮\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-e52875\" data-wf-artwork-resolved=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"artwork-fallback\" data-wf-artwork-fallback=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"92\" height=\"121\" viewBox=\"0 0 92 121\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2599-node-3\" data-wf-role=\"icon\"><ellipse cx=\"47\" cy=\"116\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#a6b9c6\"></ellipse><path d=\"M25 59Q12 42 22 24Q40 7 59 22Q73 38 64 65l7 31-20 4-29-10Z\" fill=\"#515771\"></path><path d=\"M49 77q26-8 40 16-24-10-33 7\" fill=\"#adc9cf\"></path><path d=\"m39