ext\" data-wf-element-id=\"53359\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53359\">首次开通月卡可免费领取经典精灵券</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"plan-section\">\n      <h2 data-wf-id=\"text-select-subscription-plan\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53360\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53360\">选择套餐</h2>\n      <div class=\"plan-rail\" data-wf-id=\"monthly-plan-options\" data-wf-role=\"card\" aria-label=\"月卡套餐，可左右滑动\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-monthly-plan-options\">\n        <button class=\"plan active\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"plan-recurring-year\" data-wf-role=\"tab\" data-wf-element-id=\"53361\" data-wf-tab=\"monthly-plan\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53361\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-year-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53362\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53362\">连续包年</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-year-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53363\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53363\"><small>¥</small>99.9</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-original\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-year-original\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53364\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53364\">¥189.6/年</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"plan\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"plan-recurring-quarter\" data-wf-role=\"tab\" data-wf-element-id=\"53365\" data-wf-tab=\"monthly-plan\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53365\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-quarter-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53366\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53366\">连续包季</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-quarter-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53367\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53367\"><small>¥</small>29.9</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-original\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-quarter-original\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53368\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53368\">¥47.7/季</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"plan\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"plan-recurring-month\" data-wf-role=\"tab\" data-wf-element-id=\"53369\" data-wf-tab=\"monthly-plan\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53369\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-month-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53370\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53370\">连续包月</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-month-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53371\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53371\"><small>¥</small>12.8</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-original\" data-wf-id=\"text-recurring-month-original\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53372\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53372\">¥15.8/月</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"plan\" type=\"button\" data-wf-id=\"plan-year-card\" data-wf-role=\"tab\" data-wf-element-id=\"53373\" data-wf-tab=\"monthly-plan\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53373\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\" data-wf-id=\"text-year-card-name\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53374\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53374\">年卡</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price\" data-wf-id=\"text-year-card-price\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53375\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53375\"><small>¥</small>1</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-original no-strike\" data-wf-id=\"text-year-card-duration\" data-wf-role=\"text\" data-wf-element-id=\"53376\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53376\">12个</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"agreement\">\n      <div class=\"agreement-control\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked data-wf-id=\"checkbox-monthly-agreement\" data-wf-role=\"input\" data-wf-element-id=\"53377\" data-wf-control=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"我已阅读并同意月卡服务协议和自动续费协议\" data-wf-uid=\"wf-p2607-e53377\">\n      </div>\n      <div 